{"path": "open-source/README.md", "updated": "2026-10-22T17:31:43+08:00", "url": "https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/README.md", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">开源贡献</h1>\n\n<p><strong>【仓库】</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning\">perpetual-learning</a>（AI 技术探索与贡献引擎）</p>\n<p><strong>【贡献点】</strong> 开源贡献。<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning\">项目仓库</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/WRITING.md\">文档规范</a></p>\n<p><strong>【类型】</strong> 板块总览</p>\n<p><strong>【价值评估】</strong> 8 / 10 — 统一项目导航、状态与规范，降低成果回收成本。</p>\n<p><strong>【进展】</strong> 持续维护：按项目组织材料，新文档遵守 <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/WRITING.md\">统一抬头规范</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>【大白话讲明白】</strong></p>\n<p>这里保存我们对开源项目做过的调查、修复草稿、验证与社区反馈。每份文档先把事情讲清楚，再提供技术细节；网页读取同一份摘要。</p>\n<p><strong>【What–Why–How】</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>What：</strong> 开源贡献板块的导航与内容职责。</li>\n<li><strong>Why：</strong> 文件数量不等于贡献成果，需要明确问题、价值、验证范围和真实进展。</li>\n<li><strong>How：</strong> 按项目阅读文档，沿 Issue/PR 与实验链接追溯证据，学习笔记另见 notebook。</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>按目标开源项目组织贡献候选、方案、补丁、验证和跟进。这里关注“准备贡献什么、推进到哪里”；<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md\">notebook/frameworks/</a> 关注框架原理与源码理解。两类材料相互链接，同一份成果只保留一个主要位置。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/WRITING.md\">文档撰写规范与模板</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/tools/contributions/readme.md\">抬头检查工具</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">按项目浏览</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>贡献材料</th>\n<th>学习材料</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>AReaL</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/areal/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/areal/tracker.md\">tracker</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#areal\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSpeed</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/deepspeed/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#deepspeed\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MoonshotAI</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/moonshot/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PyTorch</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/pytorch/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#pytorch\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rLLM</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/rllm/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#rllm\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SGLang</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/sglang/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#sglang\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRL</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/trl/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#trl\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UniRL</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/unirl/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/unirl/tracker.md\">tracker</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#unirl\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>verl</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/verl/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#verl\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vLLM</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/vllm/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#vllm\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vLLM-Ascend</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/vllm-ascend/readme.md\">候选、方案与记录</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/notebook/frameworks/readme.md#vllm-ascend\">源码阅读</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">跨项目规划与方法</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/open-source-contribution-opportunities.md\">贡献机会与能力匹配</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/oss-contribution-action-plan-2026-06.md\">2026 年 6 月贡献行动计划</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/open-source/SOP.md\">贡献挖掘 SOP</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>以上计划、分数与 Issue/PR 状态均为历史记录，不能作为当前优先级或贡献成效的证明。近期工作安排见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/WORK.md\">WORK.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">组织方式</h2>\n<p>每个项目使用一个目录，按需要保存 tracker、扫描报告、候选方案、验证记录及草稿。已有文件保留原名，便于追溯。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>学习：框架架构、源码分析、问题原理，保存到 notebook/frameworks/。</li>\n<li>贡献：围绕具体改进的方案、补丁、评论及 PR 草稿，保存到 open-source//。</li>\n<li>实验：复现过程与测量结论保存到 notebook/experiments/，从贡献方案链接过去。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对外发布与提交按 <a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/d1e835375e685888dc7503114f4d37d4b3b24e0b/AGENTS.md#执行边界\">AGENTS.md</a> 执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">历史扫描流程</h2>\n<p>历史流程使用 Claude Code skill <code>jackie-verl-pr</code>（本仓库未包含该技能，使用前需确认当前环境已安装），例如：\n- \"扫一遍 verl\"\n- \"verl 有什么能做的\"\n- \"verl 优化点挖掘\"</p>\n<p>Skill 会按 <code>SOP.md</code> 的 5 阶段流水线执行，产出新的 <code>scan-MMDD-HHMM.md</code> 并更新 <code>tracker.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">优先级口径</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P0</strong></td>\n<td>bugfix</td>\n<td>正确性 bug、静默错结果、崩溃 — 接受率最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P1</strong></td>\n<td>健壮性</td>\n<td>报错信息、参数校验、防御性 guard、边界条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P2</strong></td>\n<td>显存优化</td>\n<td>内存占用 / OOM 缓解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P3</strong></td>\n<td>可量化性能优化</td>\n<td>⚠️ 高失败率，必须有 profiling 证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P4</strong></td>\n<td>其他</td>\n<td>重构、文档、补测试、示例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"}